                <note rend="inline" type="source">819.00/1157: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Panama</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >South</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-02-28T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 28,
                                1925—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>24. You are authorized to act on suggestion contained in penultimate paragraph
                    your No. 25, February 27, 10 p.m. Keep Department informed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
